  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strenghtening Equity, Access and Quality in Education 2 (SEAQE2)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Youth in East Shewa and West Arsi Zones in Ethiopia will access quality, market-driven TVET delivered through SEAQE2&#x2019;s strengthened partnership with MOE and increased private sector engagement.  This targets IDPs, refugees, host community, youth with disabilities, minorities and those living in remote areas.</narrative>
  </description>
